<title>USA: Parlex sets 3-for-2 stock split.</title>
<headline>Parlex sets 3-for-2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>METHUEN, Mass. 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Parlex Corp said Tuesday its board declared a three-for-two split on its common stock to be effected through a 50 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable on April 21 to stockholders of record on March 18, it said.</p>
</text>
